# .mailmap — canonical author identity for this repository.
#
# Several historical commits were authored under variations of the same
# person's identity (a student address, display-name variants, and the GitHub
# noreply address). This file folds them into one canonical identity for
# `git log`, `git shortlog`, `git blame` and forge UIs WITHOUT rewriting
# history — commit hashes, signatures and CI references stay intact.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
# Docs:   git help mailmap

